# ── Flutter / Dart ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The Dart *build* outputs. `pubspec.lock` is deliberately NOT ignored — see the
# comment at the bottom of this file, because the default Flutter template
# ignores it and that default is wrong for an application.
